        "subject": "LU-20874 build: fix kfi sym version patch",
        "message": "LU-20874 build: fix kfi sym version patch\n\nKFI uses a KBUILD_EXTRA_SYMBOLS in own confiture checks,\nwith LU-2019 it caused an errors\nERROR: modpost: .. 'kfi_getinfo' exported twice. Previous export was\nwith configure or builds.\nLet's fix it.\n\nFixes: 1692f28 (\"LU-20219 osd-zfs: fix symvers paths\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Lyashkov <alexey.lyashkov@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I2fc1f2e4325caf46843ce1f91628a40e14bd199d\n"
